From 7fdbd3b7bfe85b0d2d7e32950c4833e92c7bf5fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:01:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test: make the eCash tier's functional tests pass ABC's lint

23 test files added or changed by the eCash tier did not pass the lint ABC
runs (ruff 0.15.8, `ruff format --check` and `ruff check` with the
repository's configuration). Format them, sort their imports, use a dict
literal in feature_mdbx_crash.py and drop an unused variable in the
loopback stress script. That script sets up sys.path before its imports
so it can run from another directory; keep that and mark those imports.

Apart from the dict literal and the dropped variable, this changes only
formatting and import order.
